r satisfaction and computer security.","company":"GlobalLogic","client":"Verizon"},{"id":86,"position":"FRONTEND REACT DEVELOPER","location":"United States, remotely.","from":"December 2023","until":"April 2024","description":"Short-term side-job where I performed as a Frontend developer for a fintech located in the US, helping on the migration from a **GraphQL** integration to a **REST API** approach, while following the **SOLID** principles and making use of tools such as ES Lint and Prettier to ensure good code quality","company":"finalis","client":null},{"id":87,"position":"FULLSTACK PHP DEVELOPER","location":"Buenos Aires, Argentina","from":"April 2023","until":"October 2023","description":"Engaged as a Fullstack PHP developer, applying my knowledge in Laravel framework to digitalize legal processes and procedures for state entities, prioritizing efficiency regarding backend responses and securing communications between Frontend and Backend via Laravel’s built in REST API methods.\n","company":"BIWINI","client":"state entity"},{"id":88,"position":"FRONTEND DEVELOPER","location":"Kyoto, Japan.","from":"April 2022","until":"March 2023","description":"Contributed to the web development team for a prestigious hotel in Kyoto. Among other things, my tasks included translating documentation from Japanese to English, updating old Class-based components to hooks and server-side rendering with Next JS and TypeScript, and helping in the process of restructuring the project’s internal architecture to follow the principles of **Clean Architecture**.","company":"TSUMUGI HOTEL","client":null}],"web_portfolio_qr_code":{"id":24,"documentId":"j06wfn6zpnbqyw1sz6g31ykn","name":"f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e.png","alternativeText":null,"caption":null,"width":1584,"height":1584,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"name":"thumbnail_f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e.png","hash":"thumbnail_f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e_3b6101cfad","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","path":null,"width":156,"height":156,"size":14.4,"sizeInBytes":14404,"url":"/uploads/thumbnail_f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e_3b6101cfad.png"},"large":{"name":"large_f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e.png","hash":"large_f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e_3b6101cfad","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","path":null,"width":1000,"height":1000,"size":43.34,"sizeInBytes":43341,"url":"/uploads/large_f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e_3b6101cfad.png"},"medium":{"name":"medium_f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e.png","hash":"medium_f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e_3b6101cfad","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","path":null,"width":750,"height":750,"size":32.69,"sizeInBytes":32686,"url":"/uploads/medium_f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e_3b6101cfad.png"},"small":{"name":"small_f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e.png","hash":"small_f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e_3b6101cfad","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","path":null,"width":500,"height":500,"size":25.97,"sizeInBytes":25967,"url":"/uploads/small_f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e_3b6101cfad.png"}},"hash":"f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e_3b6101cfad","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","size":27.81,"url":"/uploads/f519a5ac447dbdc95aa23a3fc2aeca5e_3b6101cfad.png","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-06-29T10:50:23.626Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-29T10:50:23.626Z","publishedAt":"2026-06-29T10:50:23.627Z","focalPoint":null}}},"msg":"Received entry.publish event from Platform Service: "}
